BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville's Bored Game Geeks
UID:event_315980120@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T015943Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260824T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260824T220000
SUMMARY:Game Night @ Archetype Brewing
DESCRIPTION:Asheville's Bored Game Geeks\ntldr: \\*\\*We are at Archetype 
 Brewing - West!\\*\\* Bring your favorite game(s) or learn a new one – m
 embers are always happy to teach! See you there and have a blast!\n\n🎲
 🍻 **Welcome to the Game Night Extravaganza!** 🍻🎲\n\nCalling all d
 ice-rollers\, card-shufflers\, and strategy-curious adventurers! 🌟\nAre
  weeknights feeling a tad mundane? Fear not! We’ve got the antidote: **B
 oard Games\, Brews\, and Bliss**. 🍺🎮\n\n🔥 **Our Mission:** To ign
 ite laughter\, forge alliances\, and maybe—just maybe—unleash a few fr
 iendly rivalries & battle to the death! 🤪\n\nNo PhD in rulebooks requir
 ed! Whether you’re a Settlers of Catan enthusiast or a Code Names solvin
 g ninja\, or your first time touching a board game ***we will explain all 
 the rules needed.*** 🏰🎉\n\nExpect:\n\n* **Beer on Tap**: Because rol
 ling dice is better with a pint in hand.\n* **Low Brainpower Required**: W
 e’re all about fun\, not Fermat’s Last Theorem.\n* **Epic Showdowns**:
  Ticket to Ride routes\, Splendor gem heists\, and High stakes Camel Up.\n
 \nFeel free to request any game you’d like to play or bring your own. So
  gather your guild\, stack your resource cards\, and let the games begin! 
 May your laughter be loud\, your moves be bold\, and your victory dances b
 e legendary. 🎭🎲\nSee you at the table! 🌟🍻\n\n**Feel Free to br
 ing your own games too!**\nhttp://bit.ly/LanceCollection\nhttp://bit.ly/An
 drewCollection\nhttp://bit.ly/JoshCollection\nhttp://bit.ly/EricsCollectio
 n
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevilles-bored-game-geeks/events/31
 5980120/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260804T222146Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260804T222146Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville's Bored Game Geeks
UID:event_316091032@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T015943Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260901T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260901T210000
SUMMARY:Gaming Night @ Noble Cider
DESCRIPTION:Asheville's Bored Game Geeks\nRoll the dice and pour a glass! 
 🎲🍎\n\nGaming Night is back at Noble Cider! Join us every other Tuesd
 ay for a night of tabletop tactics\, card-shuffling chaos\, and great comp
 any. Whether you’re a seasoned strategist or you still think a "meeple" 
 is a type of small fruit\, you’re welcome at our table.\n\n### The Lowdo
 wn:\n\n* **No Experience? No Problem:** We’re all about community. We’
 ll help you learn the ropes of a new game or cheer you on while you figure
  it out.\n* **The Library:** We have a solid stash of games ready to play
 —from quick party favorites to deeper strategy titles.\n* **Bring Your F
 avorites:** Have a game gathering dust on your shelf? Bring it along! We l
 ove seeing what the community is playing.\n* **The Vibe:** High-quality ci
 der\, cozy atmosphere\, and just the right amount of competitive spirit.\n
 \n**Feel Free to bring your own games too!**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevilles-bored-game-geeks/events/31
 6091032/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260812T221836Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260812T221836Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
